{"id":"cb7eec83c9952d6f","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations.md","title":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Limits and Representing Objects","display":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Limits and Representing Objects","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations","aliases":["14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations"],"display":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Limits and Representing Objects","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]","[[14-df-representable-presheaf]]","[[14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Uniqueness of Limits and Representing Objects"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bc4d1a2a9fc3b30\" href=\"?note=8bc4d1a2a9fc3b30\" title=\"14-df-representable-presheaf\">14-df-representable-presheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cf0fb3021021d3e4\" href=\"?note=cf0fb3021021d3e4\" title=\"14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful\">14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:J\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(D:J\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是小图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\pi)\">\\((L,\\pi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L&#39;,\\pi&#39;)\">\\((L&#39;,\\pi&#39;)\\)</span> 为候选极限。第二式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> 上预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为 Yoneda 嵌入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span>。自然同构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L&#39;,\\pi&#39;,D)\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(L,L&#39;)\\\n(\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\ (\\pi&#39;_j\\circ u=\\pi_j)),\\\\\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\ (\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,F,y(A))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\beta,F,y(B)))\\to\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(A,B)\\ \\mathrm{IsIso}(u).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L&#39;,\\pi&#39;,D)\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(L,L&#39;)\\\n(\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\ (\\pi&#39;_j\\circ u=\\pi_j)),\\\\\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\ (\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,F,y(A))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\beta,F,y(B)))\\to\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(A,B)\\ \\mathrm{IsIso}(u).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：极限普遍锥见 Categorical Preliminaries，印刷页 21；DjVu 第 16 图页；Yoneda 见 I.1，印刷页 26；DjVu 第 19 图页。以下是这些普遍性质的内部推论。第一式由两方向的极限泛性质分别产生 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span>；它们的复合与恒等都满足相同锥方程，故唯一性给互逆。第二式合成两个自然同构，Yoneda 完全忠实把该同构及其逆唯一反映为对象间互逆箭头。第二式只声称存在对象同构，不声称任意表示对象之间只有一个同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-representable-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"8bc4d1a2a9fc3b30","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-representable-presheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful","status":"resolved","id":"cf0fb3021021d3e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D:J\\to\\mathcal C$ 是小图，$(L,\\pi)$、$(L',\\pi')$ 为候选极限。第二式中 $F$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴 $\\mathcal A$ 上预层，$y$ 为 Yoneda 嵌入，$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal A)$。自然同构见 [[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D:J\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"(L',\\pi')","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L',\\pi',D)\\to\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(L,L')\\\n(\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(J)\\ (\\pi'_j\\circ u=\\pi_j)),\\\\\n\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\ (\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,F,y(A))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\beta,F,y(B)))\\to\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal A}(A,B)\\ \\mathrm{IsIso}(u).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"u,v","display":false}],"bytes":1879,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations|Theorem — Uniqueness of Limits and Representing Objects]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations]]"},{"id":"8bc4d1a2a9fc3b30","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里“可表示”针对反变集合值函子。$\\alpha,\\beta$ 给出与 $y(A)$ 的自然同构。表示对象的同构唯一性见 [[14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations]]；无须引用外部原子。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-uniqueness-of-limits-and-representations|Theorem — Uniqueness of Limits and Representing Objects]]"}],"outgoing":["637a464575207be3","55bd5d1a324171ab","d5f547b903550705","8bc4d1a2a9fc3b30","cf0fb3021021d3e4"]}